            "VoiceClip": "Shiroko＊Terror_Lobby_1_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0263/CH0263_Lobby_1_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Sensei, I finished some paperwork.\nHm? How did I do that if you didn't teach me?"
